  "description": "OKX 合约价格看板（BTC / ETH 永续可切换）：最新价 + 1m/3m/15m/1h/4h/1D K 线 + 可调周期 EMA（整条序列现算）+ 收线预警（穿均线提示，可桌面通知/提示音/邮件/留记录，判定常驻执行）+ 最新价线与收盘倒计时 + 可编辑画线 + 生产/模拟环境切换 + 回测面板（内置 backtest/ 框架：可选标的/策略/周期/时间范围/资金/杠杆/费率，面板内看资金曲线与交易明细）",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/altmanWang/dsh_plugin_btc_dashboard.git"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "okx",
    "crypto",
    "trading",
    "kline",
    "backtest"
  ],
  "files": [
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "plugin/dsh-btc-dashboard/index.js",
    "plugin/dsh-btc-dashboard/client.js",
    "backtest/run.mjs",
    "backtest/lib",
    "backtest/strategies",
    "backtest/tools",
    "backtest/SPEC.md",
    "backtest/INTEGRATION-SPEC.md",
    "backtest/README.md"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./plugin/dsh-btc-dashboard/index.js",
    "./client": "./plugin/dsh-btc-dashboard/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
